-| **Go** | **Accept as `go-v1`** | Direct fixed Go 1.23+ commands support one package operand. Vendor mode, private telemetry-off state, local toolchain, full dependency inspection, rejection of non-standard assembly/host objects, disabled cgo/PGO/workspaces/VCS stamping, forced internal linking with no libgcc fallback, and an empty executable-search path close the identified package-selected process/input paths. Output is never launched. |
